{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/calculus/applications-differentiation/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/calculus/applications-differentiation.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Applications of Differentiation — Calculus","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"bg-rose-600 text-white py-3 mb-6\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"font-semibold\">Applications — Differentiation</div><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/calculus/\" class=\"text-white/90\">Back</a></div></header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6\">\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Maxima &amp; Minima</h2><div class=\"muted mt-2\">Find stationary points by solving f'(x)=0. Use second derivative or sign change to classify.</div></section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Visual — turning point</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 muted\">A parabola with a maximum at x=2 (example f(x)=-x^2+4x).</div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-center\">\n        <svg width=\"420\" height=\"160\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <path d=\"M20,120 C80,60 140,40 200,50 260,60 320,90 380,120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fb7185\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n          <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"50\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#111827\"></circle>\n          <text x=\"210\" y=\"45\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#374151\">Stationary at x=2</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Worked examples</h2>\n      <div class=\"muted mt-2\">\n        <div class=\"mb-2\">1) f(x)= -x^2 + 4x → f'(x) = -2x + 4. Solve -2x + 4 = 0 → x=2 (maximum). Second derivative f''(x) = -2 &lt; 0 confirms maximum.</div>\n        <div>2) Optimization: Given perimeter 20, rectangle sides x and (10−x). Area A(x)=x(10−x)=10x−x^2. A'(x)=10−2x → set 0 → x=5. Max area 25 (square).</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">1) Find stationary points of y = x^3 - 3x^2</div><input id=\"ad1\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 0,2\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"adc1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-rose-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"adh1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"adfb1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">2) If s(t) position, what is s'(t)?</div><input id=\"ad2\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., velocity\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"adc2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-rose-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"adh2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"adfb2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">3) For A(x)=10x−x^2, at x=5 what is A''(x)? Use to classify extremum.</div><input id=\"ad3\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., -2\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"adc3\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-rose-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"adh3\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"adfb3\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">4) For f(x) = x^3−3x^2, classify x=0: min, max or inflection?</div><input id=\"ad4\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., inflection or saddle\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"adc4\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-rose-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"adh4\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"adfb4\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\"><button id=\"adQuiz\" class=\"bg-rose-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded\">Mini Quiz</button></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div id=\"adModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-40 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded p-6 max-w-md w-full\"><div id=\"adContent\"></div><div class=\"mt-4 text-right\"><button id=\"adClose\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Close</button></div></div></div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-rose-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":[".card{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.06)} .muted{color:#374151}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}